// Contract between wpkd (Go) and the Python build workers, over a local
// gRPC socket. The daemon owns the store and does no per-weight work; the
// workers do all of it (squash, training, delta extraction, codecs, evals).
//
// Blob access: the daemon hands the worker the paths of the blobs it needs,
